# Internal material: never published.
# Release strategy, future plans, research, publication drafts, and the
# maintainer's working rules for this repository. These are versioned in a
# separate private history whose metadata lives in internal/.git (see
# internal/README.md), so ignoring them here does not leave them unprotected.
internal/
CLAUDE.local.md

# Internal working logs. The tech-debt log stays at the root so that every
# reference to it keeps resolving for maintainers, while the public repository
# stops carrying it. Removed from the public index 2026-09-16; its earlier
# versions remain in public history, which this rule cannot change.
# Development_*.md catches a dev or plan log created at the root by mistake.
TECH-DEBT.md
Development_*.md

# Plans are private, including every future one. plans/ stays at the root so
# existing references resolve for maintainers; the public repository stopped
# carrying it 2026-09-16. Earlier versions remain in public history.
plans/
# A plan written at the root by mistake is caught here rather than published.
/RELEASE-PLAN*.md
/ROADMAP*.md
/*[-_]plan*.md
/*[-_]PLAN*.md
